            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Blends cleanly with your natural tooth colour.</li>
              <li>Bonds directly to tooth structure so less healthy tooth is trimmed.</li>
              <li>Stops cavities early before a root canal is needed.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F9FA] p-6 border border-slate-200">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1F2A30]">Aftercare Tips</h2>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>If numbing was used, wait until feeling returns before chewing.</li>
              <li>Avoid biting ice, hard nuts, or bottle caps with filled front edges.</li>
              <li>Brush twice daily and limit frequent sticky sweets between meals.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
